@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap 1 -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200551",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/student-assignment"
}

### 5. Du lieu khong hop le -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. Bai tap da dong -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200551",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/student-assignment"
}

### 7. Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
